# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-10-13: track the deployed model artifacts so published numbers are verifiable.
# The whole models/ directory is ~1.6 MB. Without these, a `git clone` cannot recompute
# reports/operating_point_analysis.json or reports/decision_gate_validation.json and the
# headline figures are unverifiable (audit-1 D1/D3). This is the same mechanism that lost
# models/fix_metrics.json.
#
# Placed LAST on purpose: later patterns win in git, and the earlier `*.joblib` / `*.pt`
# rules would otherwise still exclude these files.
# The large CLIP backbone, hf_cache/ and models/external_corpus/ remain untracked --
# see docs/reproduce.md 4.5.1 for how to obtain them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!models/deployment_metrics.json
!models/fusion.json
!models/feature_spec.json
!models/combined_lr.joblib
!models/forensic_lr.joblib
!models/l1b_feats.npy
!models/clip_patch.npy
!models/clip_tiles_spec.npy
!models/clip_feats.npy
